  m_text: In any room, you have the option to skip. When you skip a room, you take
    all remaining cards from the room and put them on the bottom of the deck. Once
    you've skipped a room though, you'll have to face the next one completely before
    you can skip again. If, because of skipping, at the bottom of the deck there
    are not at least 4 cards remaining you don't have to face them. You only have
    to clear full rooms
